'''Sanpeki Mokusei''' (三碧木星) is one of the {{ill|Nine Stars|ja|九星|12=draft}} used in {{ill|calendars|ja|暦|12=draft}} and {{ill|fortune-telling|ja|占い|12=draft}}. In the Post-Heaven Lo Shu Square, it occupies the eastern position.
While it belongs to the same Wood element as {{ill|Shiroku Mokusei|ja|四緑木星|1=Fourth Green Wood Star|12=draft}}, Sanpeki Mokusei represents young trees that are still growing, as opposed to mature ones.
In the daily cycle of the Nine Stars, when an intercalary period is placed around the summer solstice, the first Kanoto (甲午) day within that period is designated as Sanpeki, marking the transition from Yang to Yin. At that time, the last day of the previous Yang cycle and the first day of the new Yin cycle both belong to Sanpeki, making it appear for two consecutive days.
== Attributes == * {{ill|Wuxing (Chinese philosophy)|lt=Wuxing|ja|五行思想|1=Wuxing (Chinese philosophy)|2=ja|3=五行思想|lt=Five Elements (Wuxing)|12=draft}} - Wood * {{ill|Bagua|ja|八卦|12=draft}} - Zhen (震) * {{ill|Heavenly Stems|lt=Ten Heavenly Stems|ja|十干|12=draft}} - Jia (甲), Yi (乙) * {{ill|Earthly Branches|lt=Twelve Earthly Branches|ja|十二支|12=draft}} - Mao (卯) * Season - Spring * Direction - East * Month - March * Time - 5:00–7:00 * Number - Three, Eight * Color - Blue * Taste - Sour
== Symbolic Meanings == * Intense, movement, prosperity, cheerfulness, leadership, managerial positions, publicity, messages, communication, correspondence * Sound, voice, music, reputation, thunder (sound of {{ill|lightning|ja|雷|12=draft}}), {{ill|wave motion|ja|波動|12=draft}} (such as {{ill|sound waves|ja|音波|12=draft}} and {{ill|radio waves|ja|電波|12=draft}}), earthquakes, electricity
== Relationships with Other Stars == * Generating Cycle (相生) - {{ill|Ippaku Suisei|ja|一白水星|1=First White Water Star|12=draft}} (Water generates Wood), {{ill|Kyūshi Kasei|1=Ninth Purple Fire Star|ja|九紫火星|12=draft}} (Wood generates Fire) * Overcoming Cycle (相克) - {{ill|Nikoku Dosei|ja|二黒土星|1=Second Black Earth Star|12=draft}} (Wood overcomes Earth), {{ill|Goō Dosei|1=Fifth Yellow Earth Star|ja|五黄土星|12=draft}} (Wood overcomes Earth), {{ill|Roppaku Kinsei|1=Sixth White Metal Star|ja|六白金星|12=draft}} (Metal overcomes Wood), {{ill|Shichiseki Kinsei|1=Seventh Red Metal Star|ja|七赤金星|12=draft}} (Metal overcomes Wood), {{ill|Happaku Dosei|1=Eighth White Earth Star|ja|八白土星|12=draft}} (Wood overcomes Earth) * Harmonious Relationship (比和) - Sanpeki Mokusei, {{ill|Shiroku Mokusei|ja|四緑木星|1=Fourth Green Wood Star|12=draft}}
== Years in Which Sanpeki Mokusei Occupies the Center == Years in which the remainder when divided by 9 is 8 are Sanpeki Mokusei years.
‥‥ - [[1934]] - [[1943]] - [[1952]] - [[1961]] - [[1970]] - [[1979]] - [[1988]] - [[1997]] - [[2006]] - [[2015]] - [[2024]] - [[2033]] - [[2042]] - [[2051]] - [[2060]] - [[2069]] - ‥‥ Despite their names, the Nine Stars are not related to celestial objects like the planets in the {{ill|Solar System|en}}. == Nine Stars Comparison Chart == {{main|{{ill|Nine Stars|ja|九星|12=draft}}}} {| class="wikitable" !Star !Reading !Five Element !Direction !Eight Trigram !Color |- !{{ill|First White Water Star|ja|一白水星|1=First White Water Star|12=draft}} |Ippaku Suisei |Water |{{ill|North|ja|北|12=draft}} |{{ill|Kan|ja|坎|1=Kan (Bagua)|lt=Kan|12=draft}} | style="background:white;" |White |- !{{ill|Second Black Earth Star|ja|二黒土星|1=Second Black Earth Star|12=draft}} |Jikoku Dosei |Earth |Southwest |{{ill|Kun|ja|坤|1=Kun (Bagua)|lt=Kun|12=draft}} | style="background:black;color:white;" |Black |- !{{ill|Third Blue Wood Star|ja|三碧木星|1=Third Blue Wood Star|12=draft}} |Sanpeki Mokusei |Wood |{{ill|East|ja|東|12=draft}} |{{ill|Zhen|ja|震|1=Zhen (Bagua)|lt=Zhen|12=draft}} | style="background:blue;color:white;" |Blue |- !{{ill|Fourth Green Wood Star|ja|四緑木星|1=Fourth Green Wood Star|12=draft}} |Shiroku Mokusei |Wood |Southeast |{{ill|Xun|ja|巽|1=Xun (Bagua)|lt=Xun|12=draft}} | style="background:green;color:white;" |Green |- !{{ill|Fifth Yellow Earth Star|1=Fifth Yellow Earth Star|ja|五黄土星|12=draft}} |Goō Dosei |Earth |Center |{{ill|Taiji (philosophy)|lt=Taiji|ja|太極|fr|Taiji (philosophie)|ru|Великий предел|ja|太極|12=draft}} | style="background:yellow;" |Yellow |- !{{ill|Sixth White Metal Star|1=Sixth White Metal Star|ja|六白金星|12=draft}} |Roppaku Kinsei |Metal |Northwest |{{ill|Qian|ja|乾|1=Qian (Bagua)|lt=Qian|12=draft}} | style="background:white;" |White |- !{{ill|Seventh Red Metal Star|1=Seventh Red Metal Star|ja|七赤金星|12=draft}} |Shichiseki Kinsei |Metal |{{ill|West|ja|西|12=draft}} |{{ill|Dui|ja|兌|1=Dui (Bagua)|lt=Dui|12=draft}} | style="background:red;color:white;" |Red |- !{{ill|Eighth White Earth Star|1=Eighth White Earth Star|ja|八白土星|12=draft}} |Happaku Dosei |Earth |Northeast |{{ill|Gen|ja|艮|1=Gen (Bagua)|lt=Gen|12=draft}} | style="background:white;" |White |- !{{ill|Ninth Purple Fire Star|1=Ninth Purple Fire Star|ja|九紫火星|12=draft}} |Kyūshi Kasei |Fire |{{ill|South|ja|南|12=draft}} |{{ill|Li|ja|離|1=Li (Bagua)|lt=Li|12=draft}} | style="background:purple;color:white;" |Purple |}
