'''Sanpeki Mokusei''' (三碧木星) is one of the {{ill|Nine Stars|ja|九星|1=Nine Stars|2=ja|3=九星|lt=Nine Stars|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Nine Stars|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Nine Stars|qq=}} used in {{ill|Calendar|en|Calendar|WD=Q12132|lt=calendars|1=Calendar}} and {{ill|Divination|en|Divination|WD=Q1043197|lt=fortune-telling|1=Divination}}. In the Post-Heaven Lo Shu Square, it occupies the eastern position.
While it belongs to the same Wood element as {{ill|Shiroku Mokusei|ja|四緑木星|1=Fourth Green Wood Star|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Shiroku Mokusei|13=User:Immanuelle/Fourth Green Wood Star|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Shiroku Mokusei|13=User:Immanuelle/Fourth Green Wood Star|qq=}}, Sanpeki Mokusei represents young trees that are still growing, as opposed to mature ones.
In the daily cycle of the Nine Stars, when an intercalary period is placed around the summer solstice, the first Kanoto (甲午) day within that period is designated as Sanpeki, marking the transition from Yang to Yin. At that time, the last day of the previous Yang cycle and the first day of the new Yin cycle both belong to Sanpeki, making it appear for two consecutive days.
== Attributes == * {{ill|Wuxing (Chinese philosophy)|en|Wuxing (Chinese philosophy)|WD=Q218652|lt=Five Elements (Wuxing)|1=Wuxing (Chinese philosophy)}} - {{ill|Wood (wuxing)|lt=Wood (木)|2=it|3=Legno (elemento)|4=es|5=Madera (Wu Xing)|6=tr|7=Tahta (klasik element)|8=bcl|9=Kahoy (wuxing)|10=ca|11=Fusta (wuxing)|12=it|13=Legno (elemento)|14=es|15=Madera (Wu Xing)|16=nl|17=Hout (element)|18=vi|19=Mộc (Ngũ hành)|20=tr|21=Tahta (klasik element)|22=ta|23=மரம் (சீன மெய்யியல்)|ja_comment=jawiki link invalid}} * {{ill|Bagua|en|Bagua|WD=Q340846|lt=Bagua|1=Bagua}} - {{ill|Zhèn (Bagua)|ja|震|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Zhèn (Bagua)|lt=Zhen (震)|qq=}} * {{ill|Heavenly Stems|en|Heavenly Stems|WD=Q1190985|lt=Ten Heavenly Stems|1=Heavenly Stems}} - {{ill|Kinoe (甲)|ja|甲|zh|甲|hak|Kap (thiên-kôn)|ja|Kinoe|ko|갑 (천간)|simple|User:Immanuelle/Kinoe (甲)|za|Gyap (diengan)|zh-classical|甲|zh-min-nan|Kah (Thian-kan)|zh-yue|甲 (天干)|zh|甲 (天干)|qq=}}, {{ill|Kinoto (乙)|ja|乙|zh|乙|gan|乙|hak|Yet (thiên-kôn)|ja|Kinoto|simple|User:Immanuelle/Kinoto (乙)|vi|Ất|za|Iet (diengan)|zh-min-nan|It (Thian-kan)|zh-yue|乙|zh|乙|qq=}} * {{ill|Earthly Branches|en|Earthly Branches|WD=Q1072961|lt=Twelve Earthly Branches|1=Earthly Branches}} - {{ill|Rabbit (zodiac)|en|Rabbit (zodiac)|WD=Q844723|lt=Rabbit (卯)|1=Rabbit (zodiac)}} * Season - Spring * Direction - East * Month - March * Time - 5:00–7:00 * Number - Three, Eight * Color - Blue * Taste - Sour
== Symbolic Meanings == * Intense, movement, prosperity, cheerfulness, leadership, managerial positions, publicity, messages, communication, correspondence * Sound, voice, music, reputation, thunder (sound of {{ill|Lightning|en|Lightning|WD=Q33741|lt=lightning|1=Lightning}}), {{ill|Wave|en|Wave|WD=Q37172|lt=wave motion|1=Wave}} (such as {{ill|Acoustic wave|en|Acoustic wave|WD=Q3882459|lt=sound waves|1=Acoustic wave}} and {{ill|Radio wave|en|Radio wave|WD=Q4262|lt=radio waves|1=Radio wave}}), earthquakes, electricity
== Relationships with Other Stars == * Generating Cycle (相生) - {{ill|Ippaku Suisei|ja|一白水星|1=First White Water Star|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Ippaku Suisei|13=User:Immanuelle/First White Water Star|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Ippaku Suisei|13=User:Immanuelle/First White Water Star|qq=}} (Water generates Wood), {{ill|Kyūshi Kasei|1=Ninth Purple Fire Star|ja|九紫火星|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Kyūshi Kasei|13=User:Immanuelle/Ninth Purple Fire Star|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Kyūshi Kasei|13=User:Immanuelle/Ninth Purple Fire Star|qq=}} (Wood generates Fire) * Overcoming Cycle (相克) - {{ill|Nikoku Dosei|ja|二黒土星|1=Second Black Earth Star|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Nikoku Dosei|13=User:Immanuelle/Second Black Earth Star|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Nikoku Dosei|13=User:Immanuelle/Second Black Earth Star|qq=}} (Wood overcomes Earth), {{ill|Goō Dosei|1=Fifth Yellow Earth Star|ja|五黄土星|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Goō Dosei|13=User:Immanuelle/Fifth Yellow Earth Star|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Goō Dosei|13=User:Immanuelle/Fifth Yellow Earth Star|qq=}} (Wood overcomes Earth), {{ill|Roppaku Kinsei|1=Sixth White Metal Star|ja|六白金星|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Roppaku Kinsei|13=User:Immanuelle/Sixth White Metal Star|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Roppaku Kinsei|13=User:Immanuelle/Sixth White Metal Star|qq=}} (Metal overcomes Wood), {{ill|Shichiseki Kinsei|1=Seventh Red Metal Star|ja|七赤金星|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Shichiseki Kinsei|13=User:Immanuelle/Seventh Red Metal Star|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Shichiseki Kinsei|13=User:Immanuelle/Seventh Red Metal Star|qq=}} (Metal overcomes Wood), {{ill|Happaku Dosei|1=Eighth White Earth Star|ja|八白土星|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Happaku Dosei|13=User:Immanuelle/Eighth White Earth Star|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Happaku Dosei|13=User:Immanuelle/Eighth White Earth Star|qq=}} (Wood overcomes Earth) * Harmonious Relationship (比和) - Sanpeki Mokusei, {{ill|Shiroku Mokusei|ja|四緑木星|1=Fourth Green Wood Star|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Shiroku Mokusei|13=User:Immanuelle/Fourth Green Wood Star|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Shiroku Mokusei|13=User:Immanuelle/Fourth Green Wood Star|qq=}}
